REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# ATOMIC PRINTER LIFE_FORCE MI2336: CETP after LCAT on sterol CE-shuttle limb.
# Continuum ...->dhcr7->dhcr24->soat1->nceh1->abca1->abcg1->lcat->cetp (CETP after LCAT)
# Gift: CETP shuttles LCAT-packed CE from HDL onto apoB under ASSERT so RCT free energy redistributes without hollow HDL-only CE trap.
# Domain: post-LCAT plasma lipoprotein CE-transfer / apoB remodeling CETP ward.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder. Not a rename of LCAT.

ENTITY press OF Cell 1 62 0
ENTITY ink OF Cell 1 42 0
ENTITY dead OF Cell 0 12 0

SEND press set_threshold 9
SEND ink set_threshold 11

SEND press pulse 4
SEND press photosynth 30
SEND press glycolyse 24
SEND press charge 28
SEND press feed 22
SEND press photophos 16
GETF press energy
ASSERT LAST_N >= 20 "press energy charged"
GETF press atp
ASSERT LAST_N >= 20 "press atp charged"

SEND press amacr 2
ASSERT LAST_N == 2 "press amacr"
